        },
        {
          "text": " Kotukonok Daudi ikapolok kere luka Isirael Yerusalem, ikapolok luka atekerin, ka ikapolok luka irioneta lukebeanakinos aijaanakin eka baka, ka ikapolok luka ilukumin, ka ikapolok luka akwatat, ka ikayaitok luka iboro kere ka ibaren luka ekabaka ka odweke, nepepe kikapolokitok, ka ituŋa lukirigin, kes ituŋa kere lukirigin luetitin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
